20:T485b,<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-6861 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/content-content.jpg" alt="" width="617" height="415" /></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">What’s life without content? Well, we are all exposed to multiple types of content in some way or the other. A few types of content include social media posts, hoardings, newspapers, new channels/tv, etc, consumed daily.</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">However, If I tell you to imagine a newspaper without words, plain social media posts with no graphics no copy, a hoarding without words, an advertisement with no audio or dialogues, and Instagram without memes and reels. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Wouldn&#8217;t the world seem incomplete and impossible to function? </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">“</span></b><b><i><span data-contrast="auto">Content is now a form of communication that we all feed on, and similarly, a language brands use to engage and communicate with the audience”. </span></i></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:2,&quot;335551620&quot;:2,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2>Let’s Discuss Different Types of Content and Why it is Used:</h2>
<h3>1: Graphic/Visual Content:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Shoutout to all the graphic designers across the globe for litting up our social media &#8216;pages with colours, creativity and a dash of vibrance like no other. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Brands use visual/graphic communication for their <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/social-media-marketing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">social media</a> pages, advertisements, website pages, brochures, and more to promote their brand’s creativity and massively reach out to many audiences simultaneously. “</span><i><span data-contrast="auto">After all, what appeals to the eye appeals to the heart”. </span></i><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">In the same way, brands need visual communication to build trust, draw an image, build a certain narrative and showcase what their product or what their brand promotes. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Example: </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">When you look at a picture of a wholesome burger, why does it leave you craving for it? That’s because of the visual representation of how it looks, picture quality, use of colours, and form of advertisement, and that’s how brands sell through images and videos. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h3>2: Written Content:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Everything is incomplete without words, text, and written communication such that even a visual ad includes <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/content-marketing-services" target="_blank" rel="noopener">written content</a> to support the advertisement. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Shoutout to all the writers for awe-strikingly managing to put up the right phrases, the right words, using wordplay that make a way to catch our attention.  </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Brands use written communication in many ways, like social media ad copies, post copies, website, landing pages, blogs, articles, brochures, various ads like OOH, TV ADS, Banner ads, Pop up ads and many more. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2>Written Content Builds:</h2>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Rankings in SEO efforts</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Brand popularity </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Trust and clarity</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">More accountability </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Clearer understanding </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<h3>3: Audio &amp; Visual Content:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">We all love entertainment and keep ourselves occupied with some form of visual/ audio content be it while commuting to work, in between breaks, on a relaxing day, unwinding etc. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">While we live on visual and audio content that includes:</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Reels</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">TV Ads</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">OTT platforms</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Podcast or reality shows</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Music applications</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="6" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Movies </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Among many others. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">But if I ask you what remains constant among all of these? Well, you might have guessed it right that is advertisements. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">We consume ads through all these content types and thereby brands manage to generate a recall image/memory, audio or visual in anyone’s mind. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/neuroscience-visuals-and-sounds-in-advertisements/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Neuroscience – Visuals And Sounds In Advertisements</a></p>
<h3>4: Memes</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Memes are now the fastest, most popular, and quickest form of communication. Brands have very strategically used memes to promote their products or services. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">A fun touch of memes adds to its clear messaging line, which makes it easier to understand. Many popular brands now use meme communication to draw attention like Zomato, Swiggy and many more. Memes broadly come under content and visual communication but stand apart due to their quick and massive consumption rate. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">You may have been introduced to a certain brand, product or service due to their active social media presence thanks to the social media experts of every creative team. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">However, </span><a href="https://martech.org/social-media-driving-revenue-for-one-third-of-b2c-companies-one-fifth-of-b2b-firms-report/#:~:text=Of%20those%20surveyed%2C%2054%20percent%20of%20B2B%20marketers%20and%2060%20percent%20of%20B2C%20marketers%20said%20they%20have%20generated%20leads%20from%20social%20media.%20B2C%20companies%20lead%20in%20converting%20customers%20from%20social%20media%2C%20with%2054%20percent%20of%20those%20generating%20leads%20reporting%20revenue%20generated%20from%20social."><span data-contrast="none">According to a survey by Martech</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">, we have come to know that social media contributes to generating leads of around 54% for B2B and 60% for B2C. That’s the power of advertising on social media.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/can-you-use-memes-in-advertising-perks-of-meme-marketing/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Can You Use Memes in Advertising? Perks of Meme Marketing </a></p>
<h2>Conclusion</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">While we discussed varied types of content, we thank our team across various designations that come together in harmony to generate creativity and lead our clients to success. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">We are a </span><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b><span data-contrast="none">Digital Marketing Agency in Navi Mumbai</span></b><span data-contrast="none">,</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> helping brands with various forms of digital marketing services like SEO, PPC, Content Marketing, Branding &amp; Creatives, Employer Branding services and many more. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">So, if you are looking for a creative and reliable solution for your brands&#8217; messaging line contact our expert team:</span><b><span data-contrast="auto">  </span></b><b><span data-contrast="none">Impulse digital</span></b> <span data-contrast="auto">for top-notch services and assistance. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">And “Take your marketing journey to the road of success with us!” </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
